      "agreement": "partial",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Love love love my new phone.. I ordered my phone from Chubbiestech, it was indeed unlocked (I am using on MetroPCS) and look almost brand new! I love my new phone and hopefully they have more in stock soon so I can order one for my husband! Will update with pictures soon!",
          "aspect": "software",
          "sentiment": 0.691951263230294,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Happy so far. Recieved my Note 9 in the color I ordered. Came with 1 tiny scratch on screen (so small only noticed when cleaning to put on protector) and scratches on one outer corner (not large enough to be concerned with). Being a \"renewed\" phone it isn't surprising that it isn't completely perfect. But the physical flaws are minute. I'm new to android so I might not be the best on a tech...",
          "aspect": "software",
          "sentiment": 0.7509525567293167,
          "stars": 4,
          "month": "2019-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sold by: RUSS Cellular. I just received this flawless Note 9 yesterday. I ordered from RUSS Cellular. My lavender phone arrived in perfect condition - not a single scratch or scuff on the screen or body. It looks completely brand new. As expected, it did not come with headphones. It did however, come with brand new (or at least looks brand new) white Samsung wall chargers and usb cord, along with...",
          "aspect": "battery",
          "sentiment": 0.07447628304362297,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-01"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wondering if I should return it. I'm really disappointed in the battery life of this refurbished phone. It barely lasts a day on standby without running down the battery completely. Also, the touch screen is not responsive enough and I constantly have to swipe over and over again for drop down menus. I really wish it had a printed manual with it. Perhaps it wasn't listed as coming with one, but...",
          "aspect": "battery",
          "sentiment": -0.9914757489459589,
          "stars": 2,
          "month": "2019-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Excellent Phone. Samsung Note 9 is easy to use. Connected to my cell phone company network with no problem. The battery life is great, holds a charge for the entire day.",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
          "sentiment": 0.9802939407527447,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-01"
        }
      ]
    },
