      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "New Info to Update S/Ware and should get LTE 2-3. Updated S/W And now is 2-3G and LTE Should now operate on 4G. according to Input. Before only had 2-3G will see.",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
          "sentiment": 0.02780531719326973,
          "stars": 1,
          "month": "2021-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "I love it. I could not afford a note 9 when they first came out. I was afraid it would not update to 5g but it did and it works perfect I am so glad I bought it",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
          "sentiment": 0.9742802710970864,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fast shipping nice phone. Nice phone but I guess with buying refurbished no cable or tool to open sim card slot bummer but good customer service thus far fast shipping",
          "aspect": "performance",
          "sentiment": 0.996604545856826,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-10"
        },
        {
          "text": "I love the stylus!. I never could afford a graphic tablet with the screen in it. I'm so pleased to have this lil stylus and art note pad app to doodle with! I'm not very good with digital medium, but it's fun. ^_^ Battery also puts my old phone to shame.",
          "aspect": "software",
          "sentiment": 0.9688204790581949,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-09"
        }
      ]
    }
